# Local scratch that must never ship with the POD.
#
# era5_testslice/ holds a few days of raw ERA5 pulled off the server for local
# iteration on make_era5_digest.py, plus whatever QC plots get generated from
# it. The repo-root .gitignore already covers *.nc, but not the PDFs and other
# artefacts that land alongside them, and this directory sits inside the POD
# directory that is packaged for MDTF.
#
# The real ERA5 input is passed with --era5-root and is never copied here.
era5_testslice/
